    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Magica Planta Botanica, a deck-building strategy game where you can experience the excitement of growing your own seed into a fruit-bearing tree. Use a set of utility cards to grow, cut certain parts, or even manipulate your surroundings to your advantage. But be prepared for the unexpected \u2013 with changing weather and pesky pests, every day presents new challenges to overcome.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/3e54d5cc185c89691d67f072eef8c3c7.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/bb57b23ed3fcb807129ba289c7af9892.poster.avif?t=1746483445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/bb57b23ed3fcb807129ba289c7af9892.webm?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/bb57b23ed3fcb807129ba289c7af9892.mp4?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Imagine a game simulation of growing a tree from a seed. You can grow the roots to search for water or other sources of nutrients, or cut them loose if they're decaying or the tree doesn't have enough food to maintain its size. You can also grow and cut other parts of the tree, such as the stems, leaves, flowers, or fruits. Moreover, you can even manipulate the surroundings to your tree's advantage. Now, all of these actions are limited to only using cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/55bc380f7f78422dbc422e68f6d13a8d.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/37bc498149c7b8dc86b7985c5fd134ed.poster.avif?t=1746483445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/37bc498149c7b8dc86b7985c5fd134ed.webm?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/37bc498149c7b8dc86b7985c5fd134ed.mp4?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In combat deck-building games, you use cards to inflict damage, shield yourself, or perform other actions. In Magica Planta Botanica, cards are used to grow your tree. You can plant a root or stem toward a specific direction, grow leaves for photosynthesis, or a flower with the hope that it will bloom into a fruit. Well, even if it fails and begins to wither instead, don't fret \u2013 cut it loose! There are no more soils or water that can provide any nutrients or water for photosynthesis? Say no more, add more soils! With cards, of course. And if you have enough Miracle to use too, of course.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/ffb5d3f35c016c32e8f00c8d45c8bdd2.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/1db0cf9535a4ec456fdcbb43935b3c0a.poster.avif?t=1746483445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/1db0cf9535a4ec456fdcbb43935b3c0a.webm?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/1db0cf9535a4ec456fdcbb43935b3c0a.mp4?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not having enough food is not your only obstacle that stops you from prospering. Caterpillars, crows, and other pests can damage your precious tree. No need to worry though \u2013 when they arrive, you can repel them by the help of The Insects! The Insects are the special units you can deploy on many parts of your tree. Strategize their placements and banish all of those pests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/41cd3661d6d81ce2cfad4290f4334765.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After growing your tree and feeling satisfied, a part of you may yearn for more growing. That's where challenges come in! You can select different seeds and choose different terrains, each with its own gimmicks and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can You Nurture Your Seed into a Beautiful, Fruit-Bearing Tree? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/81220dec233851e6a6b16a7352cb00b0.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based gameplay adds strategy and planning to the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore numerous cards to develop your plant, starting with a simple starter deck and unlocking more cards as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose how your plant grows by selecting where to extend your stem, roots, and leaves. Optimize for resources, plan ahead with branching, or even shape your plant to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend your plant against invading pests! Place your units on your tree. Use the best unit and station them on the best part of your tree to deal more damage and protect your plant from harm. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against changing weather conditions, which can both hinder and help your plant's growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish all of the quests from the Spirits to gain wonderful rewards! The more quests you finish, the closer you are to the spirits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as different seeds, each with their own unique plant shape and starter deck, and strive to reach specific goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore various areas with different challenges and rewards to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take a snapshot of your beautiful creation and share it with the world, or simply add it to your collection of personal favorites.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Magica Planta Botanica, a deck-building strategy game where you can experience the excitement of growing your own seed into a fruit-bearing tree. Use a set of utility cards to grow, cut certain parts, or even manipulate your surroundings to your advantage. But be prepared for the unexpected \u2013 with changing weather and pesky pests, every day presents new challenges to overcome.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/3e54d5cc185c89691d67f072eef8c3c7.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/bb57b23ed3fcb807129ba289c7af9892.poster.avif?t=1746483445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/bb57b23ed3fcb807129ba289c7af9892.webm?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/bb57b23ed3fcb807129ba289c7af9892.mp4?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Imagine a game simulation of growing a tree from a seed. You can grow the roots to search for water or other sources of nutrients, or cut them loose if they're decaying or the tree doesn't have enough food to maintain its size. You can also grow and cut other parts of the tree, such as the stems, leaves, flowers, or fruits. Moreover, you can even manipulate the surroundings to your tree's advantage. Now, all of these actions are limited to only using cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/55bc380f7f78422dbc422e68f6d13a8d.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/37bc498149c7b8dc86b7985c5fd134ed.poster.avif?t=1746483445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/37bc498149c7b8dc86b7985c5fd134ed.webm?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/37bc498149c7b8dc86b7985c5fd134ed.mp4?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In combat deck-building games, you use cards to inflict damage, shield yourself, or perform other actions. In Magica Planta Botanica, cards are used to grow your tree. You can plant a root or stem toward a specific direction, grow leaves for photosynthesis, or a flower with the hope that it will bloom into a fruit. Well, even if it fails and begins to wither instead, don't fret \u2013 cut it loose! There are no more soils or water that can provide any nutrients or water for photosynthesis? Say no more, add more soils! With cards, of course. And if you have enough Miracle to use too, of course.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/ffb5d3f35c016c32e8f00c8d45c8bdd2.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/1db0cf9535a4ec456fdcbb43935b3c0a.poster.avif?t=1746483445\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/1db0cf9535a4ec456fdcbb43935b3c0a.webm?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/1db0cf9535a4ec456fdcbb43935b3c0a.mp4?t=1746483445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Not having enough food is not your only obstacle that stops you from prospering. Caterpillars, crows, and other pests can damage your precious tree. No need to worry though \u2013 when they arrive, you can repel them by the help of The Insects! The Insects are the special units you can deploy on many parts of your tree. Strategize their placements and banish all of those pests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/41cd3661d6d81ce2cfad4290f4334765.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After growing your tree and feeling satisfied, a part of you may yearn for more growing. That's where challenges come in! You can select different seeds and choose different terrains, each with its own gimmicks and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can You Nurture Your Seed into a Beautiful, Fruit-Bearing Tree? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336690/extras/81220dec233851e6a6b16a7352cb00b0.avif?t=1746483445\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based gameplay adds strategy and planning to the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore numerous cards to develop your plant, starting with a simple starter deck and unlocking more cards as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose how your plant grows by selecting where to extend your stem, roots, and leaves. Optimize for resources, plan ahead with branching, or even shape your plant to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defend your plant against invading pests! Place your units on your tree. Use the best unit and station them on the best part of your tree to deal more damage and protect your plant from harm. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against changing weather conditions, which can both hinder and help your plant's growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish all of the quests from the Spirits to gain wonderful rewards! The more quests you finish, the closer you are to the spirits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play as different seeds, each with their own unique plant shape and starter deck, and strive to reach specific goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore various areas with different challenges and rewards to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take a snapshot of your beautiful creation and share it with the world, or simply add it to your collection of personal favorites.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Grow a mighty tree from a tiny seed in this cozy yet strategic survival deck-builder. Build your deck, manage resources, fend off pests, and adapt through the seasons. Combining roguelite progression with a touch of tower defense, every run is a new adventure in nature!",
